  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a member, I want to flag a great post as an Alerte Qualitaÿ, so that others find it.\n\n### Scope\n\n'AQ' message action (handler for LOT-087 (#179)): per-topic check, creation form, first-use notice before the first creation (Q-4, N1).\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: easy · Priority: low · post-MVP\n- Implements: legacy parity (no FEAT)\n- Absorbs: FEATURES 'Not to lose': AQ creation; Q-4 notice\n- Legacy sources (read-only, `origin/master`): `MessagesView.swift` (`AQCreateResult`, `AQPromptState`), `AQPlusView.swift`\n- Spec: `docs/lots/LOT-134-*.md`\n\n### Depends on\n\n- LOT-055 (#81, blocked)\n- LOT-087 (#179)\n- LOT-071 (#95, done)\n\n### Blocked by\n\ndependencies not done: LOT-055 (#81, blocked), LOT-087 (#179)\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable (AGENTS.md §6: the reviewer is never the author model)\n\n### Captures needed\n\n- #133\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Nothing sent before the notice is accepted; data sent matches LOT-071 T3.\n- [ ] View logic lives in `@Observable @MainActor` models tested with Swift Testing in `App/SwiftHFRTests/`; each new test is shown to fail without the change.\n- [ ] `xcodebuild build test` green on the iPhone 18 Pro and an iPad simulator (iOS 27.0), and the `App build + tests` CI job green.\n- [ ] UI strings in French; light, dark and Dynamic Type XL checked; no new dependency; no HFR fact without a source (legacy file:line or fixture).\n\n### Before you start (agents and humans)\n\nRead, in order: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/agents/ORCHESTRATION.md, docs/agents/REVIEW-ROUNDS.md, docs/agents/LESSONS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, App/README.md, ADR 0012, the spec of every dependency (docs/lots/), docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md for any forum fact, docs/FIXTURES.md if captures are involved. Claim with `/claim <session-id>` on this issue before writing code; PR body `Closes #<this issue>` + `Claim: <session-id>`; never guess HFR behaviour (stop and list the captures needed).",
