   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-07): follow the AQ server, not legacy, for an already reported post.**\n- Legacy stops when **anyone** already reported the post (`MessagesView.swift:2001-2005` @ 2440d79).\n- The server (roger21/toyo `aq/api/addAlerte.php`, see #573) refuses only the same pseudo (`-4`), and accepts adding to an existing AQ with `alerte_qualitay_id=<id>` (\"plussoiement\").\n- LOT-134 therefore offers \"plussoyer\" on an AQ that already exists, and shows \"déjà signalé par vous\" only for the member's own report.\n- Record the divergence in GAP and CHANGELOG-LEGACY.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
